1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,450
On Mars there's no GPS,
and help can be 22 minutes away.

2
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,900
MarsNav keeps a way home on every step.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:10,500
It maps every hazard and radio shadow,
then plans safe routes.

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,800
It finds the science,
with data from seven NASA missions.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,700
It learns from the suit, and re-plans.

6
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:20,200
If a suit leaks,
every display turns the crew home.

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,400
Perseverance took 85 sols.

8
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,400
MarsNav plans it as an 84-minute walk.

9
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,600
Forty surprise walks:
no MarsNav crew touched their reserve.

10
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,400
MarsNav. Every step, a way home.

